```html
<section class="hero is-fullheight-with-navbar image-container">
  <!-- Full-size background image -->
  <img src="/static/assets/images/the founders.jpg" alt="Swing Society Founders" class="hero-background" />

  <!-- Text that can be positioned top/middle/bottom on the left -->
  <div class="hero-text text-bottom">
    <h2 class="title has-text-white">Хората, които го стартираха!</h2>
  </div>

  <!-- Button always at bottom right -->
  <div class="button-container">
    <a href="/signup" class="button is-light is-medium">Sign Up</a>
  </div>
</section>
```

Then add this CSS:

```css
/* Container for the hero image */
.image-container {
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  padding: 0; /* Remove default padding */
}

/* Make the image cover the entire section */
.hero-background {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  z-index: 1;
}

/* Text positioning classes */
.hero-text {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 2;
  padding: 2rem;
  max-width: 70%;
}

/* Different position options for text */
.text-top {
  top: 2rem;
  left: 2rem;
}

.text-middle {
  top: 50%;
  left: 2rem;
  transform: translateY(-50%);
}

.text-bottom {
  bottom: 2rem;
  left: 2rem;
}

/* Button container */
.button-container {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 2rem;
  right: 2rem;
  z-index: 2;
}

/* Optional text shadow to make text more readable on image */
.hero-text .title {
  text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
}
```

To change the text position, simply change the class on the `.hero-text` div:
- For top positioning: `<div class="hero-text text-top">`
- For middle positioning: `<div class="hero-text text-middle">`
- For bottom positioning: `<div class="hero-text text-bottom">`

This approach gives you:
1. A full-size background image
2. Text that can be positioned at the top, middle, or bottom left
3. A button that always stays at the bottom right
4. Proper z-indexing so text and button appear over the image
5. Text shadow to improve readability against varying image backgrounds

